,"source":"devex_synthetic/tickets.csv"},"text":"Ticket DEVEX-160 (task, open) for component SVC-NOTIF: \"Template editor for notification e-mails\" — Allow Comms to edit notification e-mail templates without a deploy. (created 2026-05-05)."},{"id":"Ticket:DEVEX-171","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","Ticket"],["row","4"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/tickets.csv"},"text":"Ticket DEVEX-171 (task, closed) for component SVC-INV: \"Nightly stock reconciliation job\" — Reconcile warehouse stock counts against the ledger every night. (created 2026-05-08, resolved 2026-05-22)."},{"id":"Ticket:DEVEX-187","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","Ticket"],["row","5"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/tickets.csv"},"text":"Ticket DEVEX-187 (incident, resolved) for component SVC-PAY: \"Payments CI failing: database connection timeout\" — The integration suite fails with TimeoutError: connection to payments-db timed out after 30s. Mitigated by raising the client pool timeout (PR-198). (created 2026-05-12, resolved 2026-05-14)."},{"id":"Ticket:DEVEX-195","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","Ticket"],["row","6"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/tickets.csv"},"text":"Ticket DEVEX-195 (task, open) for component SVC-SRCH: \"Synonym support in search queries\" — Search should match configured synonyms (e.g. 'sofa' ~ 'couch'). (created 2026-05-19)."},{"id":"Ticket:DEVEX-204","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","Ticket"],["row","7"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/tickets.csv"},"text":"Ticket DEVEX-204 (task, in progress) for component SVC-PAY: \"Harden payments-db client against slow connections\" — Follow-up to DEVEX-187: add retry with exponential backoff to the payments-db client so transient slowness does not fail the pipeline. (created 2026-06-05)."},{"id":"Ticket:DEVEX-209","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","Ticket"],["row","8"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/tickets.csv"},"text":"Ticket DEVEX-209 (task, open) for component SVC-CHK: \"One-click reorder from order history\" — Let a customer reorder a previous basket in one click. (created 2026-06-06)."},{"id":"Ticket:DEVEX-215","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","Ticket"],["row","9"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/tickets.csv"},"text":"Ticket DEVEX-215 (task, open) for component SVC-AUTH: \"Audit log for admin logins\" — Record every admin login with source address and outcome. (created 2026-06-07)."},{"id":"Ticket:DEVEX-231","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","Ticket"],["row","10"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/tickets.csv"},"text":"Ticket DEVEX-231 (incident, open) for component SVC-SRCH: \"search-index replica unreachable during CI\" — Integration runs intermittently fail with ConnectionResetError: search-index replica unreachable. Suspected replica eviction under memory pressure; investigating. (created 2026-06-01)."},{"id":"PR:PR-188","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","PR"],["row","1"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/prs.csv"},"text":"PR PR-188: \"Add multi-item discounts to checkout totals\" by mara.koch, branch feat/checkout-discounts, merged commit 4b762692 on 2026-05-28 — Fixes DEVEX-150: implements tiered discount bands in the totals calculator and extends the unit suite."},{"id":"PR:PR-190","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","PR"],["row","2"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/prs.csv"},"text":"PR PR-190: \"Notification e-mail templates: footer fix\" by aiko.tanaka, branch fix/notif-footer, merged commit a03370ad on 2026-05-21 — Refs DEVEX-160: first slice — corrects the footer variable in the notification templates."},{"id":"PR:PR-198","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","PR"],["row","3"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/prs.csv"},"text":"PR PR-198: \"Raise payments-db pool timeout\" by dana.petrov, branch fix/db-pool-timeout, merged commit aee8f89f on 2026-05-14 — Fixes DEVEX-187: raises the payments-db client pool timeout from 10s to 30s so slow-but-healthy connections stop failing the suite."},{"id":"PR:PR-201","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","PR"],["row","4"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/prs.csv"},"text":"PR PR-201: \"Add retry with backoff to payments-db client\" by dana.petrov, branch feat/db-retry, merged commit 04b0452b on 2026-06-09 — Fixes DEVEX-204: wraps payments-db calls in retry with exponential backoff (three attempts) and extends integration coverage."},{"id":"PR:PR-205","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"table-row","parts":[["table","PR"],["row","5"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/prs.csv"},"text":"PR PR-205: \"Rename search index aliases for clarity\" by mateo.alvarez, branch chore/index-aliases, merged commit 03dd8132 on 2026-06-06 — Renames the search index aliases to the new naming scheme. No ticket — housekeeping."},{"id":"run_R-0987:chunk1","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"log-span","parts":[["lines","1-1"],["section","header"],["chunk","1"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/logs/run_R-0987.log"},"text":"=== run R-0987 | pipeline payments-service CI | commit bd66dca0 | branch main | started 2026-05-12T09:14:00Z ==="},{"id":"run_R-0987:chunk2","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"log-span","parts":[["lines","3-5"],["section","checkout"],["chunk","2"]]},"source":"devex_synthetic/logs/run_R-0987.log"},"text":"--- job: checkout ---\n09:15 INFO  fetching sources at bd66dca0\n09:15 INFO  checkout complete"},{"id":"run_R-0987:chunk3","origin":{"ingested_at":"2026-06-10","locator":{"kind":"log-span","parts":[["lines","7-9"],["section","build"],["chunk","3"]]},"source":"devex_